# Terms of Use

**Provider**
Wolfgang Rathgeb
wr@dropanote.de
Germany

**Service**
embodi cms is a CMS interface for static site generators. The software is in alpha and free to use.

**Use at Your Own Risk**
No warranties provided. I'm not liable for data loss, downtime, or any other damages. Since all your content is versioned in your Git repository, you can always revert to previous versions.

**Repository Access**
You grant embodi cms access to your Git repositories only when you explicitly click the import button. Access happens exclusively through your Git provider's official API (currently GitHub, GitLab/Codeberg coming later).

**Termination**
You can stop using the service anytime by revoking OAuth access in your GitHub settings. Account deletion is not currently implemented.

**Changes**
I may update these terms. You'll be notified by email for significant changes.
